,\n    .agent-table col:nth-child(3) {\n      width: 22%;\n    }\n\n    .agent-table col:nth-child(4) {\n      width: 12%;\n    }\n\n    .agent-table thead th {\n      font-size: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .agent-table tbody td {\n      padding-top: 13px;\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .agent-note {\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      color: #615d5d;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 300;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n\n    .page-footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 118px;\n      bottom: 45px;\n      left: 54px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #5f5a5a;\n    }\n\n    .footer-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      gap: 33px;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      color: #2c2929;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 34px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .report-name {\n      color: #f25516;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .company-name {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 300;\n    }\n\n    @media print {\n      @page {\n        size: 1654px 2339px;\n        margin: 0;\n      }\n\n      body {\n        min-width: 0;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        margin: 0;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"page-header\">\n      <h1>业绩综述</h1>\n      <h2>寿险及健康险业务</h2>\n    </header>\n\n    <section aria-label=\"代理人产能及收入\">\n      <table class=\"financial-table\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col>\n          <col>\n          <col>\n          <col>\n        </colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n            <th class=\"current\">2024年</th>\n            <th>2023年</th>\n            <th>变动(%)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"section-row\">\n            <td colspan=\"4\">代理人产能及收入</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>代理人渠道新业务价值<sup>(1)</sup></td>\n            <td class=\"current-value\">31,870</td>\n            <td>25,187</td>\n            <td>26.5</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>代理人人均新业务价值<sup>(1)</sup>(元／人均每年)</td>\n            <td class=\"current-value\">101,271</td>\n            <td>70,689</td>\n            <td>43.3</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>代理人活动率<sup>(2)</sup>(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current-value\">52.8</td>\n            <td>53.3</td>\n            <td>下降0.5个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>代理人收入(元／人均每月)</td>\n            <td class=\"current-value\">10,395</td>\n            <td>9,813</td>\n            <td>5.9</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"last-data-row\">\n            <td>其中：寿险收入(元／人均每月)</td>\n            <td class=\"current-value\">8,227</td>\n            <td>7,402</td>\n            <td>11.1</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"table-notes\">\n        <p>注：(1) 当期及去年同期的新业务价值基于2023年末的长期投资回报率假设(4.5%)和风险贴现率假设(9.5%)计算。</p>\n        <p>　　(2) 代理人活动率＝当年各月出单代理人数量之和／当年各月在职代理人数量之和。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"main-content\">\n      <div class=\"content-grid\">\n        <div>\n          <section class=\"content-section\">\n            <h3>银保渠道</h3>\n            <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n              <li>聚焦价值经营，高质量发展成效显著。2024年，银保渠道新业务价值同比增长62.7%。</li>\n              <li>深化“5+5+N”策略，与5大国有行深化合作，全面拓展5家全国性股份行合作，并挖掘N家潜力城商行寻求增量；扩大优质合作网点，落实标准化网点经营动作，提升经营效能。</li>\n              <li>强化队伍绩优建设，提升队伍专业能力和产能。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section class=\"content-section community-section\">\n            <h3>社区金融服务及其他渠道</h3>\n            <p class=\"plain\">社区金融服务渠道方面，平安寿险持续推广社区金融服务经营模式，网点和队伍保持高质量发展，客户经营价值持续突破。</p>\n            <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n              <li>价值方面，2024年，存续客户<sup>(1)</sup>13个月保单继续率同比提升5.7个百分点，新业务价值同比提升近300%。</li>\n              <li>网点方面，截至2024年末，已在93个城市铺设131个网点，较年初增加42城66个网点。</li>\n              <li>队伍方面，截至2024年末，已组建近2.4万人的高素质、高绩效、高品质的“三高”精英队伍。</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <div class=\"community-note\">\n              注：(1) 存续客户指与平安寿险终止代理关系的代理人在代理关系终止之前，其所代理销售的有效保单\n              <span class=\"continuation\">客户。</span>\n            </div>\n          </section>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"callout-column\" aria-label=\"关键数据\">\n          <div class=\"callout\">\n            <p class=\"callout-value\">62.7<span class=\"unit\">%</span></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"callout-label\">银保渠道新业务价值同比增长</div>\n\n          <div class=\"callout-group-secondary\">\n            <div class=\"callout-stat\">\n              <div class=\"callout\">\n                <p class=\"callout-value\">131<span class=\"unit\">个</span></p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"callout-label\">已在93个城市铺设网点数</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"callout-stat\">\n              <div class=\"callout\">\n                <p class=\"callout-value\"><span class=\"unit\">近</span>2.4<span class=\"unit\">万</span></p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"callout-label\">已组建“三高”精英队伍人数</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"lower-channel\">下沉渠道方面，2024年平安寿险持续在7个省份推进销售，创新并迭代业务模式，逐步探索形成稳定的产能路径。</p>\n\n      <section class=\"agent-section\" aria-label=\"个人寿险销售代理人数量\">\n        <h3>个人寿险销售代理人数量</h3>\n        <table class=\"financial-table agent-table\">\n          <colgroup>\n            <col>\n            <col>\n            <col>\n            <col>\n          </colgroup>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>平安寿险</th>\n              <th class=\"current\">2024年12月31日</th>\n              <th>2023年12月31日</th>\n              <th>变动(%)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"last-data-row\">\n              <td>个人寿险销售代理人数量(万人)</td>\n              <td class=\"current-value\">36.3</td>\n              <td>34.7</td>\n              <td>4.6</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"agent-note\">注：个人寿险销售代理人数量指与平安寿险公司签订代理保险业务合同的人员数量，含代理人渠道、银保渠道、社区金融服务及其他渠道。</div>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"page-footer\">\n      <div class=\"footer-left\">\n        <span class=\"page-number\">32</span>\n        <span class=\"report-name\">二零二四年年报</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"company-name\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司</div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
